m</strong>: $6.24 commission​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3327\" data-start=\"3210\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3327\" data-start=\"3212\"><strong data-end=\"3240\" data-start=\"3212\">Micro Needle Dermaroller</strong>: $4.00 commission​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<p data-end=\"3454\" data-start=\"3329\">Commissions are paid in USD. <br>Based on long-term performance, affiliates may qualify for a commission increase.​</p>\r\n<hr data-end=\"3459\" data-start=\"3456\">\r\n<h3 data-end=\"3486\" data-start=\"3461\"><strong data-end=\"3486\" data-start=\"3465\">Other Information</strong></h3>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4348\" data-start=\"3488\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3600\" data-start=\"3488\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3600\" data-start=\"3490\"><strong data-end=\"3513\" data-start=\"3490\">Exclusive Discounts</strong>: Affiliates receive a permanent 30% discount code for personal purchases.​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"3717\" data-start=\"3602\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3717\" data-start=\"3604\"><strong data-end=\"3630\" data-start=\"3604\">Complimentary Products</strong>: Members of the Eliot family are periodically gifted complimentary products.​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4195\" data-start=\"3719\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3831\" data-start=\"3721\"><strong data-end=\"3744\" data-start=\"3721\">Performance Bonuses</strong>: Affiliates can earn additional bonuses based on units sold:​</p>\r\n<ul data-end=\"4195\" data-start=\"3835\">\r\n<li data-end=\"3922\" data-start=\"3835\">\r\n<p data-end=\"3922\" data-start=\"3837\">2,500 units: $1,000 bonus​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4013\" data-start=\"3926\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4013\" data-start=\"3928\">5,000 units: $2,500 bonus​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4104\" data-start=\"4017\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4104\" data-start=\"4019\">10,000 units: $5,000 bonus​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4195\" data-start=\"4108\">\r\n<p data-end=\"4195\" data-start=\"4110\">20,000 units: $10,000 bonus​</p>\r\n</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</li>\r\n<li data-end=\"4348\" data-start=\